  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "By banning mods, you ban accessibility to your game for a lot of the disabled community who rely on vrc for socialization due to crippling disabilities. \nText to Talk is a mod for people who can't actually sign in vrc due to the hand movements not translating correctly. \nThere are Anti-Seizure mods so that people can enjoy going to worlds and stuff that didn't have seizure trigger warnings or people using flashing avatars, without risking their lives. \nThere are subtitle mods that allow deaf people to be able to see what people are talking about so they can enjoy the game as well. \nThere are mods that allow people to translate written words into speech so that dyslexic people can enjoy the game as well. \nSo many people depend on non-malicious mods to enjoy your game. And a lot of the non malicious mods actually provide protection against the malicious mods. \nIf you do go through this, then please add more accessibility to your game.",
